l, Sniper is a boss killer, ETC ETC\n-co-op is not permadeath. if even one player survives, the entire team is rezzed at the next level.", "timestamp_created": 1482525302, "timestamp_updated": 1482525302, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "28562012", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084605065", "personaname": "IcyScrumpy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IcyScrumpy/", "num_games_owned": 399, "num_reviews": 103, "playtime_forever": 1372, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 814, "last_played": 1577326397, "avatar": "077485fc17ad46529f5f49696e43ea65d626b069"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game ain't so bad.\n\nBesides the fact that I seem to be always dieng on the 4th stage no matter how hard I try\nand unlocking charcters is a slight pain\nbut the game plays fun\nand if it plays like a fun\nthen it is the fun worth of a checking out\nbuy\nis christmas time\nso buy", "timestamp_created": 1482500945, "timestamp_updated": 1482500945, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "28557110", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990881456", "personaname": "Charmartel", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lordjiffy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 164, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 69, "last_played": 1490757683, "avatar": "cb1aa489891f2fae30fdaa08047f61678899bda5"}, "langua